co delicioso!', 24.99, 24.99, NULL, 'Food & Beverages > Snacks > Chocolate', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-7r98o-m1x5f3gqdb7sf4', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F318555124%2F4083217737', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
