i Flex 5p - Volkswagen Tiguan Allspace 2021 2.0 R-line 350 Tsi 4motion 5p - Volkswagen Tiguan Allspace 2021 2.0 R-line 350 Tsi 4motion 5p marchas - Volkswagen Tiguan Allspace 2021 2.0 R-line Black Style 350 Tsi 4motion 5p - Volkswagen Tiguan Allspace 2024 2.0 R-Line 300 Tsi Aut. 4P', 164.9, 164.9, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > External Parts', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134201-7r98o-m3fkvhrw3x7f8c', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F687222661%2F23698004097', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
